The set of input forms Result Report allows you to: 
 
- view on screen the output results presented in tables, graphs and plots
- copy and past results in ASCII or picture format from DSealect to MS Word 
or MS Excel documents
- generate a report in MS Word format
 
 
Use the form Results Overview to view comparative tables and charts 
presenting an overview of the results.
 
 
Use the form Detailed Results to view detailed results in the 
form of charts, graphs and plots.
 
 
Use the form Generate Report to choose the report options and to 
generate a MS Word report presenting in a structured way all the 
results available in the forms Results Overview and Detailed Results.
 
                